    <entry_item>
      <dico>Boberg</dico>
      <unicode>ᠬᠠᠲᠠᠭᠠᠬᠣ</unicode>
      <uighur>qadaγaqu</uighur>
      <definition>v.t. To dry at a fire or in the sun. To cause withering or drying. To temper steel or harden iron.</definition>
      <page>563</page>
